        "prompt": "Square background, modern corporate style. Base: very light neutral gray canvas (near #efefef) with a subtle paper texture and a faint, soft vignette toward edges. Right-side folded ribbon wedge: two overlapping diagonal panels intruding from the right edge at a shallow inward angle (~20° from vertical). The back panel is solid black, slightly wider; the front panel is a deep burgundy (rich desaturated red) about 30% of canvas width. Add a narrow inner crease/highlight along the front panel edge and a soft, blurred drop shadow cast leftwards onto the gray background to sell the fold. At the very bottom-right corner create a small triangular fold accent where the panels meet, with a subtle bevel and shadow. Upper middle: a thin, solid black horizontal rule at about 26% down, spanning about 47–71% across (just right of where the lead-in text ends), ~3–6 px equivalent thickness. Lower-right icon cluster: a simple flat silhouette group of three people in solid black (center figure slightly forward), sized so the group occupies roughly the lower-right quadrant (about 25–30% of canvas height). Above the central silhouette place a small burgundy question mark matching the ribbon color. Keep all shapes crisply cut with minimal gradients except for soft shadows and the subtle ribbon bevel. Overall lighting: flat with delicate ambient shadows for depth, clean vector-style edges, minimal noise. No text, lettering, logos or watermarks anywhere in the image.",
