        "notes": "All free text is black (the hero word is burgundy) and sits in the left ~60% of the canvas, top to bottom, so that area must stay a very light, calm neutral with no dark shapes — never dark or busy, even for a moody brief. Keep the dark ribbon panels on the right edge only. The people-silhouette icon with the question mark is part of this background (there is no separate photo layer), so it stays in the lower-right quadrant, clear of the job list on the left. The two small burgundy button shapes behind 'We Need' and 'Apply Now' are separate layers."
